# Super-OS Branding
---
componentName: superos

# Display strings
productName: Super-OS
shortProductName: Super-OS
version: 2025.01
shortVersion: 2025.01
versionedName: Super-OS 2025.01
versionedShortName: Super-OS
bootloaderEntryName: Super-OS

# Paths
productLogo: /usr/share/pixmaps/super-os.png
productIcon: /usr/share/pixmaps/super-os.png
productWelcome: /usr/share/pixmaps/super-os.png

# URLs
productUrl: https://github.com/super-os
supportUrl: https://github.com/super-os/support
knownIssuesUrl: https://github.com/super-os/issues
releaseNotesUrl: https://github.com/super-os/releases

# Colors
style:
  sidebarBackground: "#1a1a2e"
  sidebarText: "#e0e0e0"
  sidebarTextSelect: "#ffffff"
  sidebarTextSelectBackground: "#16213e"
  listViewBackground: "#f5f5f5"
  buttonBackground: "#0f3460"
  buttonText: "#ffffff"

# Slideshow
slideshow: ""
slideshowAPI: 2

# Strings
strings:
  productName: Super-OS
  shortProductName: Super-OS
  bootloaderEntryName: Super-OS

# Welcome page
welcome:
  showSupportUrl: true
  showKnownIssuesUrl: true
  showReleaseNotesUrl: true

# About
about:
  description: |
    <h2>Super-OS</h2>
    <p>Windows 11 + Android — 全部运行在 Linux 上</p>
    <ul>
      <li>完整 Windows 11 虚拟机 (KVM + GPU 直通 + Looking Glass 零延迟)</li>
      <li>98%+ AAA 游戏原生性能 (独显 VFIO 直通)</li>
      <li>Android 应用原生支持 (Waydroid 容器)</li>
      <li>KDE Plasma 6 Wayland 中文桌面</li>
      <li>NVIDIA / AMD / Intel GPU 全品牌支持</li>
      <li>Fcitx5 中文拼音输入法, Ctrl+Space 切换</li>
      <li>清华/中科大/阿里云镜像源, 安装更新极速</li>
    </ul>
